Portions of the design draw on architectural patterns from the
Zed editor (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed). Specifically,
the splittable pane tree (crates/seoul-app/src/pane_group.rs),
the tab item trait (crates/seoul-app/src/item.rs), and the
coalescing PTY-read loop (crates/seoul-app/src/terminal_view.rs)
were inspired by the corresponding ideas in Zed. The implementations
in this repository were written from scratch and do not include
copied source from Zed. Inline source comments mark each location.

The `gpui` and `gpui_platform` crates from Zed, which this project
depends on, are themselves licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
